sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Al as Alert
    participant Eng as Responder
    participant K as Kubernetes
    participant Node as GPU node
    participant Run as Runbook
    Al->>Eng: inference latency is up
    Eng->>Run: open the matching runbook first
    Eng->>K: is it one node or the fleet?
    alt one node
        Eng->>Node: dmesg, XID errors, clock throttling
        Node-->>Eng: a failing GPU
        Eng->>K: cordon and drain it
    else the fleet
        Eng->>K: what changed — image, config, or traffic?
        K-->>Eng: a recent rollout
        Eng->>K: roll back first, diagnose after
    end
    Eng->>Run: record what the runbook missed
    Note over Eng,Run: the postmortem's real output is a better runbook, not a list of blame
